    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 3 of the Nation Building Tax Act, No. 9 of 2009(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the section asamended is\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
