  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      364.37,
      401.9,
      412.91
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the Nation Building Tax Act, No. 9 of2009 as last amended by Act, No. 9 of 2012 (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby furtheramended as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
